          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"pricing.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Investment — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#6b8e74;--muted:#7a7a7a;--bg:#ffffff;--card:#fbfbfb;--radius:12px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:#111;background:var(--bg)}\\n    .container{max-width:900px;margin:56px auto;padding:32px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    .hero{padding:48px 0 28px}\\n    .kicker{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n    h1{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px}\\n    .tiers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\\n    .tier{border-radius:10px;padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfcfb);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,32,0.06)}\\n    .tier h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}\\n    .price{font-weight:700;font-size:20px;margin-top:8px}\\n    .list{margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{margin-top:42px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .leadmag{background:#f6faf7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:20px}\\n    .faq h4{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .process{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-direction:column;margin-top:14px}\\n    .step{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">INVESTMENT & STRUCTURE</div>\\n      <h1>Transparent options to change daily habits into lasting wellbeing</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Choose the framework that fits your life rhythm. Each path centers outcomes, small habit shifts, and weekly accountability led by {{COACH_NAME}}.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <main>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tiers\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n              <h3>Starter Foundations</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"price\\\">$240 / 6 weeks</div>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">A gentle entry for new routines: weekly teaching, habit tracker, email check-ins.</p>\\n              <ul class=\\\"list\\\">\\n                <li>4 live coaching sessions</li>\\n                <li>Personalized habit plan</li>\\n                <li>Email summaries & reflections</li>\\n              </ul>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n              <h3>Momentum Method</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"price\\\">$720 / 12 weeks</div>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">A focused pathway for steady change with weekly coaching and twice-monthly accountability calls.</p>\\n              <ul class=\\\"list\\\">\\n                <li>12 coaching sessions</li>\\n                <li>Goal scaffolding and checkpoints</li>\\n                <li>Access to recordings & worksheets</li>\\n              </ul>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve a consult</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n              <h3>Renewal Cohort</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"price\\\">$2,500 / 6 months</div>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">For people ready to redesign their daily systems. Includes custom framework building and priority support.</p>\\n              <ul class=\\\"list\\\">\\n                <li>Bi-weekly deep sessions</li>\\n                <li>Framework creation + habit library</li>\\n                <li>Ongoing message support</li>\\n              </ul>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Inquire</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Why these options?</h4>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Each tier is designed around behavior change principles: clear cues, small increments, and consistent reflection. You’ll get a practical plan rather than vague goals.</p>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <section class=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-heading\\\">\\n            <h4 id=\\\"faq-heading\\\">Questions people ask</h4>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <strong>How do I know which tier fits me?</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">We start with a 20-minute clarity call to map your rhythms and decide a matched path.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <strong>Are there refunds?</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">We offer a satisfaction-first transfer policy within the first 14 days; details provided on booking.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <strong>Can I switch tiers mid-way?</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">Yes. Many clients scale as momentum builds. We'll pro-rate accordingly.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">What to expect — the process</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"process\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>1. Clarity Call</strong> — 20 minutes to identify the first practical step.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>2. Personalized Plan</strong> — a simple habit roadmap you can start this week.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>3. Execution & Reflection</strong> — weekly sessions focus on tiny wins and adjustments.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"leadmag card leadmag\\\">\\n          <strong>Free Guide:</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0 10px\\\">\\\"Five Gentle Shifts to Reset Your Routine\\\" — instant PDF to try evidence-informed micro-habits today.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"/\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;width:100%\\\" />\\n            <button class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;margin-top:10px\\\">Get the guide</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px;\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Hear from people who started</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"The small steps added up — I sleep better and plan my days with intention.\\\" — S.</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"{{COACH_NAME}} turns overwhelm into a simple practice.\\\" — J.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px;text-align:center\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Ready to begin?</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a clarity call</a>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"testimonials.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Stories — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#6b8e74;--muted:#8a8a8a;--bg:#ffffff}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#111}\\n    .wrap{max-width:880px;margin:56px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:26px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .card{background:#fbfbfb;padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .testimonial{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(17,17,17,0.04)}\\n    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#222}\\n    .by{margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .leadmag{background:#f6faf7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}\\n    .benefits{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:14px}\\n    .benefit{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"lead\\\">Practices that fit your life — real people, real rhythms</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Main</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Meet</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <main>\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Voices of change</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Short reflections from people who practiced new rhythms and gained steady outcomes.</p>\\n\\n          <article class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"I stopped waiting for motivation and built a nightly routine that actually sticks. The gentle steps made it feel possible.\\\"</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"by\\\">— A., educator</div>\\n          </article>\\n\\n          <article class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"Within eight weeks I had consistent energy and clearer mornings. The framework is simple and compassionate.\\\"</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"by\\\">— M., parent</div>\\n          </article>\\n\\n          <article class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"Working with {{COACH_NAME}} helped me stop burnout cycles. The focus on habits rather than perfection changed everything.\\\"</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"by\\\">— K., entrepreneur</div>\\n          </article>\\n\\n          <section style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Featured case: The Week-by-Week Shift</h4>\\n            <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">A twelve-week client transformed fragmented routines into a calm, repeatable morning ritual through incremental habit steps and weekly reflection. Results emphasized steadier energy and clearer priorities — no dramatic overhaul required.</p>\\n          </section>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">What clients appreciate</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"benefits\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">Concrete tools for nightly and morning habits.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">A compassionate framework that reduces pressure.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">Simple accountability to sustain momentum.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"leadmag card leadmag\\\">\\n          <strong>Try a short reset</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0\\\">Download \\\"Three Tiny Practices for Calmer Days\\\" — a short worksheet to start tonight.</p>\\n          <form>\\n            <input name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;width:100%\\\" />\\n            <button class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;margin-top:10px\\\">Send me the worksheet</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Select praise</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"Practical and steady.\\\" — T.</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"I finally sleep through the night.\\\" — R.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:inline-block\\\">Schedule a call</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Quick FAQs</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Do you offer sliding scale?</strong> Occasionally for short-term support; inquire on booking.</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Is this counseling?</strong> This coaching focuses on habits and systems, not clinical therapy.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Book a Session — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#6b8e74;--muted:#888}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:#fff;color:#111}\\n    .wrap{max-width:760px;margin:56px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{margin-top:18px}\\n    h1{margin:6px 0;font-size:26px}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .form-card{background:#fbfbfb;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:16px}\\n    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin-top:6px}\\n    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:none;margin-top:12px}\\n    .mini{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .process{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .process div{background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .social{margin-top:18px}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Work</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>Schedule a 20-minute Clarity Session</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">A brief conversation to map one immediate, practical step you can use this week. No pressure — just clarity and a simple plan.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <div class=\\\"form-card\\\">\\n        <form action=\\\"/book\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"First & last\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"service\\\">Choose a focus</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"service\\\" name=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <option>Morning Simplification (15 min follow-up)</option>\\n            <option>Evening Reset & Sleep Routine</option>\\n            <option>Workday Energy Planning</option>\\n            <option>Custom: Habit Mapping</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"notes\\\">Short note — what feels most urgent?</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"notes\\\" name=\\\"notes\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"A sentence or two is fine\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"times\\\">Preferred times (optional)</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"times\\\" name=\\\"times\\\" placeholder=\\\"Mornings, evenings, specific days\\\" />\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request a slot</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"mini\\\" style=\\\"align-self:center\\\">Or schedule via the main booking link</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p class=\\\"mini\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Sessions are offered virtually. A short intake will confirm fit and availability.</p>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"background:transparent;padding:0\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">What this session achieves</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"process\\\">\\n            <div><strong>Listen</strong><div class=\\\"mini\\\">Understand your current pattern</div></div>\\n            <div><strong>Choose</strong><div class=\\\"mini\\\">One practical habit to try</div></div>\\n            <div><strong>Plan</strong><div class=\\\"mini\\\">Steps and a simple check-in</div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"social\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fbfbfb;padding:14px;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Client snapshot</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"mini\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\\"That single session gave me one concrete change I relied on for months.\\\" — L.</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"mini\\\">\\\"I left with a plan I could actually do — and I did it.\\\" — B.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Practical details</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"mini\\\">A short session is complimentary for new clients. Multi-session packages and longer coaching options are available after the clarity session.</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"mini\\\">If you prefer, call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Questions people ask before booking</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"mini\\\"><strong>Is this for mental health?</strong> This is habit-focused coaching and is not a substitute for clinical care.</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"mini\\\"><strong>How many sessions will I need?</strong> Many clients start with 6–12 weeks; the clarity call will help us choose.</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"mini\\\"><strong>Do you work with time zones?</strong> Yes — we’ll coordinate a convenient time for you.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Free starter worksheet</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"mini\\\">Get a short reflection that prepares you for the call. It helps make the first session efficient and gentle.</p>\\n        <form>\\n          <input placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;width:60%\\\" />\\n          <button class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;margin-left:8px\\\">Send worksheet</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
